  "description": "The Vaporesso LUXE XR Max 2 is one of the most powerful and versatile devices in the Luxe X family, combining advanced features with a compact, stylish pod-mod design. With a staggering 3200mAh built-in battery, adjustable 80W output, and support for both replaceable coils and integrated pods, this kit is capable of effortlessly adapting to any vaping style — from mouth-to-lung (MTL) to direct-to-lung (DTL). Powered by Vaporesso’s AXON chipset, the LUXE XR Max 2 offers three intelligent vaping modes: Pulse Mode for more intense flavour and vapour delivery, ECO Mode to extend battery life, and (normal) Smart Mode, which automatically adjusts wattage based on your coil resistance. These modes can be selected via a bright 0.96” TFT screen with tactile wattage controls, and with dynamic RGB lighting that responds in real time for a more engaging experience. The kit includes two Luxe XR Pods – one for DTL and one for MTL – both refillable and designed to be used with replaceable GTX coils . It arrives pre-installed with a 0.2ohm Dual Mesh coil for rich, open DTL draws and includes a 0.8ohm Mesh coil for tighter, smoother MTL performance. We recommend paring the the pre-installed coils with the following E-Liquid: Vaporesso GTX Dual Mesh 0.2ohm coil - Use High VG ( Sub-Ohm) E-Liquid ONLY - Choose Double Dip. Vaporesso GTX Dual Mesh 0.8ohm coil - Use 50/50 Freebase , Nic Salt s E-Liquid - Choose Double Drip Nic Salt. Complete your setup by choosing a vape juice that naturally suits this kit. Use the 0.8ohm MTL pod with your free Double Drip Nic Salt E-Liquid. The device is also fully compatible with Luxe X Pods (sold separately), which feature integrated mesh coils for users who prefer a simpler, closed-coil system. Combining refined ergonomics, one-button locking, a protective silicone base and a choice of stylish colourways – including two faux leather finishes – the Luxe XR Max 2 offers premium performance in a powerful, adaptable and highly portable device. Please Note: To improve the performance and longevity of your new Coils, always prime them with your chosen e-liquid before inserting into your device 'Priming’ simply means wetting the exposed cotton or similar wicking material with e-liquid before use. This helps prevent dry hits and burning the coil should it fail to soak up e-liquid properly before firing the vape device. Once you've primed your pod, attached it to your device, allow to stand for 5-10 minutes before vaping.",
